          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193860_956418_27948"/>
          <body> the function performed by the signing Organization with respect to the contract. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'contractor': The referenced Organization assigns the tasks that are subject of the Contract; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'contractee': The tasks that are subject of the Contract are assigned to the referenced Organization.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt; </body>
