          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193376_512578_24614"/>
          <body> one of the two Approval objects related by the ApprovalRelationship. If one element of the relationship is dependent of the other, this attribute shall be the independent or owning one. &lt;note&gt; The semantics of this attribute are defined by the attribute RelationType.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
