        <body>An AddressAssignment is an association of an Address with a Person or PersonInOrganization. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to an AddressAssignment: ActivityMethod, Approval, Condition, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, PropertyValue, ExternalPropertyDefinition, and PropertyDefinition.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
