    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193129_379681_23619" xmi:uuid="34b50d2b-2bf9-4e9b-8bf0-40b27f19c930" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455111485218_832713_42332" xmi:uuid="b34d14e0-b363-4333-8c4c-149c3d9dc9df" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193129_379681_23619"/>
        <body>An InformationRight is a definition of what may or may not be done with an item of information in the sense of legal rights and obligations. &lt;example&gt; Copyright is an InformationRight. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; For the purposes of developing a new system, details of government furnished equipment may be made available to a specific project team. The team may copy and use the information internally, but may not pass it on, either to a third part, or to another team, and must destroy the information at the end of the contract. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to an InformationRight: InformationUsageRight.&lt;/note&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>InformationRight</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193622_460398_26437" xmi:uuid="6a267ee0-6eb3-499a-ae80-a7bae0c4d19b" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../DocumentManagement/DocumentManagement.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193076_372354_23525"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193770_58650_27450" xmi:uuid="e0cf9ca2-f820-48e8-bc25-af417a28ccdc" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193131_678926_23622"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193770_80559_27449" xmi:uuid="f8fb231b-9e62-407d-a8ea-623bf11dbfca" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193259_964911_23867"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193770_370478_27451" xmi:uuid="24cc09f0-c7de-4f33-8d2f-c5aaa6008522" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455111512282_718303_42333" xmi:uuid="e0aa39d0-f121-4dcd-9a62-8cf9a2d9e7af" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193770_370478_27451"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the InformationRight. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Id</name>
