    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_317812_23777" xmi:uuid="5691878f-4c9b-4353-bb23-e749d978b597" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455708944221_442255_42802" xmi:uuid="65b96881-66f4-47e0-bb8d-62857949388b" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193199_317812_23777"/>
        <body>A Project is an identified program of work. It is a set of activities to create a product or service in accordance with specified resources and requirements. &lt;note&gt; A Project may be further characterized with planned or actual dates, allowed budget, activities or resources by attribute values of this business object or by assignments to other business objects. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;For the development of a new car, a project is set up that is responsible for the development decisions, as well as for the accounting of the costs.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Project</name>
