            <body> &lt;sch:rule context="//ProjectRelationship[@uid]"&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="entity_name" value="if(@xsi:type) then substring-after(@xsi:type,':') else name()"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelating" value="../@uid"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:let name="uidRelated" value="Related/@uidRef"/&gt;&#13; &lt;sch:assert test="not(../@uid = Related/@uidRef)"&gt;&#13; The related Project and the relating Project shall be different. &#13; {&#13; -entity_name:&lt;sch:value-of select="$entity_name"/&gt;&#13; -entity_uid:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt; &#13; -rule_name:ProjectRelationship.WR1&#13; -relating:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelating"/&gt;&#13; -related:&lt;sch:value-of select="$uidRelated"/&gt;&#13; }&#13; &lt;/sch:assert&gt;&#13; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459331505535_611367_42699" xmi:uuid="4bf959b9-63c2-4daa-b6ea-7a32525c6aea" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1459331466180_419965_42697"/>
          <body>the related Project and the relating Project shall be different.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1671209121966_349520_163210" xmi:uuid="a46dbc95-abed-4c7f-bc6d-9ef343e068fb" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
