      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193965_274192_28487" xmi:uuid="84ccda56-ef8e-4aa6-ab0f-d663f1af6485" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455709572154_66184_42817" xmi:uuid="575281f5-9af5-44c9-be1d-d2d14e447ad2" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193965_274192_28487"/>
          <body> the meaning of the assignment. Where applicable, the following values shall be used: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;'project scope': the AssignedTo object is defined within the AssignedProject, that is, the AssignedProject is the owner of the AssignedTo object; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'project correspondence': the AssignedTo object represents a correspondence to the AssignedProject, that is, there shall be a 1:1 correspondence between the AssignedProject and the AssignedTo object . The types of valid AssignedTo objects are limited to BreakdownElement and ProductClass; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'work program': the AssignedTo objects are carried out in the AssignedProject. In this case, the AssignedTo object shall be of type Activity; &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;'affected objects': the AssignedTo object is affected by the work carried out by the AssignedProject.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
