    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193035_377009_23439" xmi:uuid="94837e1f-6b04-40ee-a932-757bd9d47679" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1455708226125_216722_42762" xmi:uuid="ed0b66b6-867d-4975-89f4-0a7c855b9fe3" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193035_377009_23439"/>
        <body>A Certification is a written assurance by a third party that a product, process or service conforms to specified requirements. A Certification may be associated with a document that asserts the satisfaction of specific quality criteria. &lt;note&gt; Certification information may be attached to a product, tool, process, activity, service or the skill of a person for a certain task.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Certification</name>
