          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193453_844715_25177"/>
          <body> the words or set of words by which the Certification is known. &lt;example&gt; 'AP 242 certified' is an example of a name that may be used to indicate a certification of a STEP interface. &lt;/example&gt;&lt;example&gt; 'ISO 9000' is an example of a name that may be used to indicate that a product has been developed following ISO 9000 directives.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
