        <body>A PersonInOrganization is the specification of a PersonInOrganization in the context of an Organization. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to a PersonInOrganization: ActivityMethod, Approval, Contract, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, Effectivity, InformationUsageRight, PropertyValue, ExternalPropertyDefinition, PropertyDefinition, and WorkRequest.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
