        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193160_637137_23695"/>
        <body>An Organization is a group of people involved in a specific business process. &lt;note&gt; The following additional data can be assigned to an Organization: ActivityMethod, Contract, DateTimeString, Document, DocumentVersion, DocumentDefinition, File, InformationUsageRight, and WorkRequest.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
