          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the Organization. &lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;example&gt;The id may be the code assigned to the Organization for a stock market listing, or it may be a department number.&lt;/example&gt;</body>
