          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513939343726_21970_61107"/>
          <body>the identifier or set of identifiers for the ProductGroup.&lt;note&gt; This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
