        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513939829817_115047_61172"/>
        <body>A ProductGroupRelationship is a relationship between two ProductGroups. &lt;note&gt; A subset is a common type of relationship. It indicates that one ProductGroup is a subset of another.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
